<section class="phero"><div class="phero-bg" data-parallax="0.15"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hurricane-debris.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hurricane-debris-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hurricane-debris.webp 1024w" sizes="100vw" width="1024" height="682" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li aria-current="page">Claim advice</li></ol></nav><p class="kicker">Guides</p><h1>Mississippi Insurance Claim Advice and Guides</h1><p class="lede">Practical guides on Coast deductibles, wind vs. water, tornado and ice-storm documentation, policy language and reading an estimate.</p></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="cards cards-3" data-stagger><article class="card post rv"><a class="card-img" href="/claim-advice/wind-vs-water-after-katrina/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hurricane-boat.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hurricane-boat-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hurricane-boat.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="card-b"><small class="meta">Aug 3, 2026 · 8 min read</small><h2><a href="/claim-advice/wind-vs-water-after-katrina/">Wind vs. Water Claims in Mississippi: What Katrina Still Teaches</a></h2><p>Katrina made wind-versus-flood disputes a fixture of Coast claims. Here is what appraisal can value, what it can’t decide, and how to build a wind record.</p></div></article><article class="card post rv"><a class="card-img" href="/claim-advice/mississippi-appraisal-clause-guide/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consultation.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consultation-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consultation.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="card-b"><small class="meta">Aug 24, 2026 · 8 min read</small><h2><a href="/claim-advice/mississippi-appraisal-clause-guide/">The Mississippi Appraisal Clause, Read Line by Line</a></h2><p>What the typical appraisal clause in a Mississippi property policy says, how each step works, and where its limits are.</p></div></article><article class="card post rv"><a class="card-img" href="/claim-advice/coast-hurricane-deductibles-explained/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/coastal-home.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/coastal-home-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/coastal-home.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="card-b"><small class="meta">Sep 14, 2026 · 7 min read</small><h2><a href="/claim-advice/coast-hurricane-deductibles-explained/">Coast Hurricane Deductibles: The Math Behind a Named Storm Claim</a></h2><p>Percentage hurricane deductibles can swallow a Coast claim. See the math for 2% and 5% deductibles, how split policies work, and when the deductible applies.</p></div></article><article class="card post rv"><a class="card-img" href="/claim-advice/documenting-tornado-damage/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/tornado-roof.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/tornado-roof-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/tornado-roof.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="card-b"><small class="meta">Oct 5, 2026 · 7 min read</small><h2><a href="/claim-advice/documenting-tornado-damage/">After the Siren: Documenting Tornado Damage in Mississippi</a></h2><p>A step-by-step checklist for recording tornado and straight-line wind damage so your claim reflects everything the storm did.</p></div></article><article class="card post rv"><a class="card-img" href="/claim-advice/ice-storm-tree-claims-north-mississippi/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/ice-storm.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/ice-storm-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/ice-storm.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="card-b"><small class="meta">Oct 19, 2026 · 8 min read</small><h2><a href="/claim-advice/ice-storm-tree-claims-north-mississippi/">Ice Storm Tree Claims in North Mississippi: Limits, Roofs and Pipes</a></h2><p>Ice brings down limbs, loads roofs and bursts pipes. Learn how tree limits, roof damage and freeze losses are usually handled.</p></div></article><article class="card post rv"><a class="card-img" href="/claim-advice/line-by-line-estimate-reading/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/estimate-laptop.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/estimate-laptop-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/estimate-laptop.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="626" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="card-b"><small class="meta">Nov 9, 2026 · 8 min read</small><h2><a href="/claim-advice/line-by-line-estimate-reading/">Decoding Your Carrier’s Estimate, One Line Item at a Time</a></h2><p>A plain guide to the parts of an Xactimate-style estimate and the omissions that most often shrink a Mississippi property claim.</p></div></article></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap band-in rv"><div><h2>Not sure the carrier’s number is right?</h2><p>Send the estimate and a few photos. We’ll review it and tell you what we see — no obligation.</p></div><div class="btns"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1